sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Client
  participant API as Auth API
  participant Blacklist as Redis Blacklist
  participant JWT as JWT Helpers
  participant Mongo as MongoDB

  rect rgb(245, 248, 255)
    Client->>API: Protected API request with Bearer access token
    API->>Blacklist: Check blacklist:{accessTokenDigest}
    Blacklist-->>API: Not blacklisted
    API->>JWT: Verify access JWT issuer, audience user, HS256, expiry
    JWT-->>API: Access payload userId + tokenVersion
    API->>Mongo: Load user tokenVersion
    Mongo-->>API: Current tokenVersion
    API-->>Client: Protected response
  end

  rect rgb(248, 255, 245)
    Client->>API: POST /auth/refresh-token with refresh cookie
    alt request also carries blacklisted access token
      API->>Blacklist: Check blacklist:{accessTokenDigest}
      Blacklist-->>API: Blacklisted
      API-->>Client: 401 session must sign in again
    else no blacklisted access token is attached
      API->>JWT: Verify refresh JWT issuer, audience refresh, HS256, expiry
      JWT-->>API: Refresh payload userId
      API->>Mongo: Find active refresh-token digest
      Mongo-->>API: Active refresh token + user tokenVersion
      API-->>Client: New access token
    end
  end

  rect rgb(255, 248, 245)
    Client->>API: POST /auth/logout with refresh cookie and access token
    API->>Mongo: Revoke active refresh-token digest
    API->>JWT: Try verify access JWT for expiry
    alt access token verifies and has exp
      API->>Blacklist: SET blacklist:{accessTokenDigest} EX ttl
    else access token invalid or expired
      API->>API: Skip blacklist write
    end
    API-->>Client: Clear refresh cookie and return logout success
  end
